<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Seartec share premium to be reduced.</title>
<headline>Seartec share premium to be reduced.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seartec Ltd said on Tuesday that shareholders had agreed to the reduction of the company's share premium and distribution to shareholders out of share premium.</p>
<p>The special resolution had been lodged for registration by the Registrar of Companies, it said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
